      },
      "payload": {
        "finding_id": "R1",
        "reason": "Fix incomplete at plugins/gin-workflow/src/scripts/workflow_core/team.py:256-268: the optional /.* suffix still consumes nested GitLab project paths after /pull/<digits>. Reproduced on f6f538e: origin git@gitlab.corp.com:group/pull/123/app.git and MR https://gitlab.corp.com/group/pull/123/other/-/merge_requests/3 both normalize to gitlab.corp.com/group. check_approval(requirement_confirmed) with eligible approval and matching artifact returns [] for these different repositories, violating Requirement 1. Parse PR/MR suffixes in their host-specific URL structure and preserve the entire remote project path; add a numeric-subgroup regression proving cross-repository gate rejection. The added nonnumeric pull/app regression does not cover this case."
      },
      "previous_event_hash": "b5dd503083d082185f92dc964e6c38718b542ea65bfc7fc43b396f9593993e50",
